# Convex backend

- Every org-scoped query/mutation: `requirePermission` (or equivalent) before data access.
- Indexes first; avoid full table scans. Bound `.take()` / pagination on list endpoints.
- Schema changes stay additive and intentional — update `schema.ts` with the code that needs them.
- Device ingest: credentialed, rate-limited, honest health transitions (`deviceHealth`, freshness windows).
- Never log secrets, JWTs, device credentials, or raw auth headers.
- Prefer deterministic sorts in queries when UI order matters (e.g. roster by last activity).
- Tests: convex/vitest coverage for authz, health, and ingest edge cases when touching those paths.
